  "body": "Beautifully built new homes that CCC ready, title issued! Ready to move in anytime!\r\nWith striking architectural lines, dark and white exterior accents, and a clean, symmetrical facade, they create a bold yet elegant street presence. Floor-to-ceiling windows and glass balconies flood the interiors with natural light and give a boutique, urban edge that blends effortlessly into this premium development.\r\n\r\nFeatures a clever layout with a study nook and guest toilet on the ground level, along with internal garage access. The first floor hosts a generous open-plan living and dining space that opens to a sunny balcony at the front and a private backyard off the kitchen - perfect for indoor-outdoor flow. A stylish breakfast bar adds everyday convenience. Upstairs includes three well-sized bedrooms, with the master bedroom enjoying its own ensuite for extra comfort, and sea view. \r\n\r\n-Spacious living/dining area opens to balcony and backyard\r\n-Kitchen with breakfast bar for casual meals\r\n-3 upstairs bedrooms including a master with ensuite\r\n-Internal access garage\r\n\r\nJust a few minutes' walk to Half Moon Bay shops, cafés, the supermarket, and the ferry terminal, making your city commute a breeze. Plus, the bus stop is literally just steps from your door. Zoned for top schools: Pigeon Mountain Primary and Farm Cove Intermediate.",
